as learned that a pennsylvania  state grand jury has heard evidence  about jeter's possible involvement in  the murder of rachel deltando  aaron moriarty joins us now erin so  sheldon jeter is guilty of that other  murder why is he suspected in the  teacher murder well i want to make a  point though that this is a true  whodunit i mean it is not absolutely  sheldon at all what we do know is that  she was likely killed by someone she  knew because she was coming home it's  late at night someone lured her to the  end of the driveway and then shot her  point-blank  they look at sheldon because she had  been mentoring him and that relationship  may have turned romantic he had been 17  at the time 30. we've heard that kind of  story before but as you also heard  sheldon's attorney says there is no  evidence that ties him to it um and  there may have been other people who  were angry with her yeah but as your  reporting showed there was a student who  might have passed sheldon on the road on  the way in the direction of it was  sheldon but with other people i mean it  did make him look bad but there's no  evidence to time to the murder looking  bad doesn't mean you committed that's  right exactly as we know when i come  here all the time with my stories  about people wrongly convicted yes those  stories yeah aaron moriarty thank you  very much you can watch aaron's full  report who killed rachel del tondo on 48  hours tomorrow night at 10 9 central  here on cbs and on the viacom cbs  streaming service you know it it's  called paramount plus
 

